From: HST Office
Subject: [PATCH] File panel: "Xuất PDF dạng sách" and "Cập nhật HST Office"

- Export page: "Export as PDF Booklet" ("Xuất PDF dạng sách") runs .uno:ExportDirectToPDF with
  FilterData Booklet = true (filter side: hst-pdf-export-booklet.patch), so the user picks the file
  and gets two pages on each sheet in fold order, the Word-like booklet print.
- Info page: "Update HST Office" ("Cập nhật HST Office") runs the bundled extension's
  org.hst.office.update:Available (install the release a check found, else check now), or :Check
  with an extension that lacks it; the entry is hidden without the extension. The line "A new
  version is ready to install." shows when that command's status (IsEnabled) says a newer release
  is known; the dot on the File tab listens to the same status.
- English and Vietnamese strings.

License: MPL-2.0
Test: tests/runtime/check-backstage-flows.py (booklet FilterData, update entry, status note);
tests/unit/test_update_handler.py (the extension side)
---
